Do not silently replace an unavailable model with the endpoint's first model

When a model spec, preset or conversation names a model missing from the
endpoint's model list, buildDefaultConvo dropped it and parseConvo picked the
first listed model, so requests went to a different model without notice. Keep
the requested model (the server's validateAgentModel rejects it visibly) and
show a warning toast. A stale lastSelectedModel still falls back as before.

